<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1834307355"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:30.776"><div begin="16.455" end="42.223" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="16.455" end="27.003" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="16.455" end="18.226">爱的第一</span><span begin="18.226" end="19.635">天</span> <span begin="20.367" end="21.818">真以为</span><span begin="21.818" end="23.274">我们</span><span begin="23.627" end="25.296">能走到永</span><span begin="25.296" end="27.003">远</span></p><p begin="29.212" end="35.910" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.212" end="30.019">那些</span><span begin="30.019" end="31.109">画面</span><span begin="31.109" end="32.423">多体贴</span> <span begin="32.711" end="33.537">那些温</span><span begin="33.537" end="34.590">柔的</span><span begin="34.590" end="35.910">语言</span></p><p begin="36.386" end="42.223" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.386" end="37.619">还要一</span><span begin="37.619" end="39.417">起计划去</span><span begin="40.287" end="40.806">探</span><span begin="40.806" end="42.223">险</span></p></div><div begin="44.629" end="1:09.922" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="44.629" end="55.359" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.629" end="46.612">眼角闪烁</span><span begin="46.612" end="48.046">无言</span> <span begin="48.557" end="50.553">我能感觉</span><span begin="50.890" end="51.782">我</span><span begin="51.782" end="53.441">们两个世</span><span begin="53.441" end="55.359">界</span></p><p begin="57.467" end="1:04.179" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.467" end="58.207">爱变</span><span begin="58.207" end="59.158">得不</span><span begin="59.158" end="1:00.011">再熟</span><span begin="1:00.011" end="1:00.557">练</span> <span begin="1:00.782" end="1:01.010">连</span><span begin="1:01.010" end="1:03.464">拥抱都不再热</span><span begin="1:03.464" end="1:04.179">烈</span></p><p begin="1:04.556" end="1:09.922" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.556" end="1:05.288">像冷</span><span begin="1:05.288" end="1:05.914">空</span><span begin="1:05.